# Wix's output sRGB ICC profile, 456 bytes, base64.
# Extracted from the iCCP chunk of a CDN render. Using this as the
# icc_transform DESTINATION is what makes wide-gamut masters byte-exact:
# vips' built-in srgb gives 99.472%, this gives 100.000%.
# D65 white point with a 42-point sampled TRC, unlike the D50 parametric
# profiles that lcms and vips ship.

